/ActualText (About me\nProduct Designer with 8 years of experience designing enterprise and B2B products across complex workflows, data-heavy interfaces, and web applications. I work across the product lifecycle from understanding user problems and defining solutions to prototyping, UI design, and collaborating with engineering to bring products to life.)
